OL,3,GNEWSACharity match for PCs killed in
OL,4,Acrash raises #10k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football match hosted in memory of
OL,7,Ftwo police officers killed in a crash
OL,8,Fhas raised more than #10,000 for
OL,9,Fcharity.
OL,11,FPC Matthew Blades, 37, and PC Tom
OL,12,FClough, 38, died when a Volkswagen
OL,13,FPassat travelling the wrong way down
OL,14,Fthe A66, near Middlesbrough, crashed
OL,15,Finto their marked police car on 22
OL,16,FAugust. Five young men in the Passat
OL,17,Falso died.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
