OL,3,GNEWSACharity match for PCs killed in
OL,4,Acrash raises #10k
OL,5,
OL,6,FMiddlesbrough FC hosted about 1,000
OL,7,Fstaff from Cleveland Police and their
OL,8,Floved ones at the Riverside Stadium on
OL,9,FSunday, for the inaugural Blades and
OL,10,FClough Cup.
OL,12,FThe two teams were supported by Boro
OL,13,Fplayers Craig Hignett and Dimi
OL,14,FKonstantopoulos.
